miniTV is a new short video drama app, where you can watch a variety of smooth and high-quality short dramas.

Bored of monotonous movies and TV shows? Try our miniTV. We have various types of story content, whether it's modern or ancient, fantasy or science fiction, there's always content that suits you.

Time travel drama: A useless loser returns to the past and uses modern knowledge to become a king;
Love drama: A girl must marry a billionaire she doesn't like to save her father;
Revenge drama: A poor child who is bullied turns out to be an extraordinary martial artist who doesn't want to reveal his identity.

Each episode of our drama only lasts 2 minutes, but the thrilling plot will definitely make you addicted. You can watch our short dramas anytime, anywhere, whether you're eating, riding a bus, or even queuing, open our app, it only takes 2 minutes, you can watch one episode, fill your spare time.
